---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="The Journey"
  description="From London to Dubai — the background of Jamal Akim, entrepreneur working across property, ventures and media."
  canonicalPath="/journey"
>
  <section class="article-header wrap">
    <div class="card-eyebrow">Journey</div>
    <h1>Still moving, not finished</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">Updated as the story continues</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>My name is Jamal Akim. I'm British, raised in London, with Jamaican and Saint Lucian roots — and I'm currently based in Dubai.</p>
      <p>The path here hasn't followed one straight line, and I don't think it should have. Different chapters — military training, sales, financial services, recruitment, property, leadership — have each shaped how I think about discipline, risk, people and opportunity.</p>

      <h2>London</h2>
      <p>Where the standards started. Family, discipline, and an early sense that I wanted to build something of my own eventually.</p>

      <h2>Military training</h2>
      <p>Structure, pressure, and getting things done regardless of how you feel about it that day. Lessons that still shape how I lead and how I work.</p>

      <h2>Sales, financial services & recruitment</h2>
      <p>Years learning how to sell honestly, how to read people, how to negotiate, and — eventually — how to lead a team rather than just hit a number myself.</p>

      <h2>Dubai & property</h2>
      <p>The move to Dubai and into real estate — a new market, a new pace, and a steep learning curve in investor relationships and property advisory.</p>

      <h2>Now: entrepreneurship & media</h2>
      <p>Building ventures beyond property, and documenting the process in public — through conversations, content and this website — rather than waiting until there's a finished story to tell.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
